1	// Shared plumbing for the SEO content pipeline.
2	//
3	// Articles live as one JSON file per post under content/seo/. Body copy is an
4	// ARRAY of block-level HTML strings rather than one giant escaped string: it
5	// keeps diffs readable, keeps line length sane, and makes it obvious when a
6	// block was added or removed. `bodyHtml` — the column the DB actually stores —
7	// is derived here by joining those blocks, so there is exactly one definition
8	// of the transform and the validator and the seeder can never disagree.
